        "description": "<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/warhammer-survivors_5jrmIgw.jpg?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp\" /> <p>You know my favourite thing about <a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/games/vampire-survivors\">Vampire Survivors</a>? The slow build of strength, the swelling power fantasy, <em>the edging</em>. Developer Poncle has proved itself incredibly adept at goading players into ever more ludicrous setups, demonstrating that with some patience, a canny eye for build-crafting, and some very rudimentary knowledge of your surroundings, even an old man armed with garlic can be an extinction level event for the amassing undead. <a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/games/warhammer-survivors\">Warhammer Survivors</a> sadly never reaches those heights.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/warhammer-survivors-now-playing\">Read more</a></p>",
